---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Affiliate & Editorial Disclosure | AIO AI" 
  description="Transparent editorial disclosure, verification criteria, and affiliate transparency policies governing the AIO AI catalog."
  hideSidebar={true}
>
  <header class="border-b border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between sticky top-0 z-30">
    <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
      <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-[#09090B] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs tracking-tight">
        AI
      </div>
      <span class="text-[#09090B] font-black tracking-tight text-base">AIO AI</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-[#09090B] font-medium transition-colors">← Back to Overview</a>
  </header>

  <main class="w-full flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="border-b border-[#E2E8F0] pb-8 mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold text-emerald-700 mb-4">
        <span>PRD SECTION 52 COMPLIANCE — 100% EDITORIAL INTEGRITY</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-[#09090B] tracking-tight mb-3">
        Affiliate & Editorial Disclosure
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm font-mono">
        Strict separation of commercial affiliate relationships and platform ranking scores.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-sans">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">1. Zero Pay-for-Placement Ranking</h2>
        <p>
          AIO AI does not accept payment, sponsored fees, or kickbacks in exchange for higher search placement, inflated Platform Scores, or featured recommendations on our leaderboard. All rankings and recommendations generated by our AI Finder algorithm are computed strictly from verified capability, value-for-money metrics, community reviews, and open-source accessibility.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">2. Affiliate Links Transparency</h2>
        <p>
          Some external links to commercial software products on AIO AI may contain affiliate tracking codes. If you register or purchase a subscription through these outbound links, AIO AI may receive a small referral commission at zero additional cost to you.
        </p>
        <p>
          Affiliate relationships never influence whether a tool is included in the catalog or how it is evaluated. Free and open-source self-hostable alternatives are always prominently featured alongside commercial offerings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">3. Verification Badges & Audit Criteria</h2>
        <p>
          Every tool cataloged with a "Verified Active" badge has undergone our 4-point verification checklist:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Domain Status:</strong> Active HTTPS connection returning HTTP 200 OK.</li>
          <li><strong>Working Product:</strong> Functional public sign-up or live API endpoint (not just a waitlist landing page).</li>
          <li><strong>Clear Pricing:</strong> Transparent published pricing tiers or documented free plan limits.</li>
          <li><strong>No Malicious Behavior:</strong> Zero hidden crypto-miners, deceptive malware extensions, or undisclosed telemetric spyware.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">4. Open Source & India-First Independence</h2>
        <p>
          Open-source repositories and Indian foundation models (Sarvam, Krutrim, Bhashini, Hanooman) receive identical indexing rigor and zero commercial bias, supporting the global open-weights ecosystem and national digital sovereignty.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
